### TASK 8 — Transient mode
**Goal:** Companion cursor appears during interaction, hides when done.
Matches Clicky's "Show Clicky off" behavior.

Build:
1. Add transientMode: boolean to Config.ts (default: false)
2. When transientMode = true:
   - Launcher button is always visible (persistent)
   - Cursor overlay is hidden at rest
   - On any voice/text interaction start: fade cursor in (200ms)
   - On TTS complete + 1000ms inactivity: fade cursor out (300ms)
   - Response bubble fades out with cursor
3. When transientMode = false (default):
   - Current behavior: cursor stays visible

Files: modify src/overlay/CursorOverlay.ts, modify src/overlay/OverlayRoot.ts,
       modify src/core/ClickyClient.ts, modify src/core/Config.ts

Acceptance criteria:
- transientMode: true hides cursor between interactions
- Cursor appears within one animation frame of interaction start
- Fade in/out are smooth (no flash)

